--------------------------------------------------
1. PRODUCT VISION
--------------------------------------------------

Gunari is a mobile-first web application that recreates the night sky from a meaningful moment in someone's life.

Users enter a date, time, location, title, and an optional message. Gunari generates a beautifully designed, high-resolution artwork that can be downloaded and shared instantly.

Gunari is not an astronomy application.

It is a memory experience where the night sky becomes the medium for storytelling.

