--------------------------------------------------
10. CUSTOMIZATION
--------------------------------------------------

Theme (10)

The Theme defines the overall mood of the artwork.

Each theme automatically controls:

- Canvas background
- Star chart background
- Typography colors
- Compass colors
- Constellation colors
- Accent colors

Themes

1. Blank
2. Midnight
3. Obsidian
4. Ivory
5. Slate
6. Twilight
7. Aurora
8. Moonlight
9. Cosmos
10. Dusk

Notes

- Every theme includes a matching Canvas Background and Star Chart Background.
- The Star Chart Background is a circular surface that sits inside the canvas.
- The Star Chart is rendered on top of the Star Chart Background.
- The Compass Ring surrounds the Star Chart Background.
- The Theme ensures all colors remain visually harmonious.

--------------------

Frame (4)

1. Blank
2. Classic
3. Midnight
4. Aurora

The frame surrounds the artwork and never overlaps the canvas.

--------------------

Compass (3)

Default

Enabled

Selecting Blank disables the compass.

Compass Styles

1. Blank
2. Minimal
3. Compass Rose

Notes

- The compass always encircles the Star Chart Background.
- Theme determines its colors.
- Only the compass artwork changes.

--------------------

Star Chart (2)

1. Astronomical

Scientifically accurate appearance with subtle glow.

2. Dreamscape

Same astronomical data with a softer, more romantic appearance.

