13. GUNARI WORDMARK
--------------------------------------------------

Purpose

Acts as the artist's signature.

Placement

Inside the canvas.

Bottom center.

Small.

Elegant.

Low opacity.

It should never feel like a watermark or advertisement.

--------------------------------------------------
14. RESPONSIVE LAYOUT
--------------------------------------------------

The composition automatically adapts.

Examples

Without Message

- Title shifts downward slightly.

Without Compass

- Star chart scales slightly larger.

Without Frame

- Canvas gains additional breathing room.

No customization should leave awkward empty spaces.

